  "claim_boundary": "Operator V6 adds the Phase 7 universal knowledge fabric beside the specialized causal record lane. The first content-addressed pack seeds all fifteen declared domain families with forty-five reviewed claims and twenty-two source records while preserving formal, empirical, interpretive, fictional, and craft distinctions. This is domain-level foundation coverage, not exhaustive human knowledge. Source text remains untrusted, the language model cannot promote claims or write memory, and every tool still requires explicit approval of one exact manifest. Phase 6 permissioned hands, grounded causal evidence, graph RAG, abstention authority, provider privacy, atomic transactions, and both user-visible side views remain runtime-wired at or above the Ornith 1.0 capability floor. This is an adversarial experimental platform, not a claim that prompt injection is solved, medical output is clinical advice, or unattended production autonomy is safe."
